repository-code: "https://github.com/[YOUR-GITHUB-USERNAME]/patient-xai"
keywords: [longitudinal machine learning, explainable AI, counterfactual, uncertainty, digital twin, synthetic data]
abstract: >-
  Pre-application research demonstrator. Not a medical device. Trains a discrete-time survival
  logistic baseline and a GRU deep ensemble on a synthetic longitudinal cohort with a known
  data-generating process, and audits model-based counterfactual simulations against
  simulator ground truth.
